//! Tests for the waiting-music tracker (jingle v2): golden bytes for the
//! hand-assembled SPC700 driver, tracks, and BRR-encoded instruments, plus
//! end-to-end playback through the full IPL boot protocol.
//!
//! The golden arrays were generated by a reference implementation and
//! byte-verified by running the assembled driver on a reference SPC700
//! simulation against an independent spec-level model of the intended
//! behavior (4885 identical DSP writes over two full song loops). A golden
//! mismatch therefore means "re-verify the driver", not "update the
//! constant".

